le="background-color:#00AAFF22"></div><div class="relative flex min-w-0 items-center gap-3"><div class="relative h-12 w-12 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-full" style="border:2px solid #00AAFF80;box-shadow:0 0 18px #00AAFF55"><img alt="Flicker" loading="lazy" width="48" height="48" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="h-full w-full object-cover" style="color:transparent" src="/images/spells/flicker.png"/></div><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="flex items-center gap-1 font-heading text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em]" style="color:#00AAFF"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-zap h-2.5 w-2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z"></path></svg>Battle Spell</p><p class="mt-0.5 truncate font-heading text-base font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text sm:text-lg xl:text-base">Flicker</p></div></div></div></div><div class="relative grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden border border-mlbb-gold/18 bg-surface-1/45 sm:grid-cols-4 lg:col-start-1 lg:row-start-2 lg:self-start" style="box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(240,208,96,0.08)"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold-bright/50 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative min-w-0 bg-surface-2/85 px-3 py-2 sm:px-4 sm:py-3" title="Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe, Endless Battle, Malefic Roar"><p class="truncate font-heading text-[9.5px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-mlbb-text-secondary/85">Physical Attack</p><p class="mt-1 font-heading text-[18px] font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight text-mlbb-text sm:text-[22px]"><span class="text-mlbb-gold-bright">+225</span></p></div><div class="relative min-w