50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use when the enemy physical threat is split across multiple sources and you need the stacking CC reduction and adaptive attack rather than single-source Deter debuff.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/oracle">Oracle</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/athenas-shield">Athena&#x27;s Shield</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use when magic damage is sustained poke rather than one-shot burst, and you have a healer support whose shields and heals on you are raised by 25% through Oracle&#x27;s Bless passive.</span></li><li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 gap-y-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary"><a class="font-heading font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/radiant-armor">Radiant Armor</a><span class="inline-flex items-baseline gap-1.5 text-[11px] uppercase tracking-wide text-mlbb-text-secondary/80"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right relative top-[1px] h-3 w-3 text-text-accent/65" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg><span class="text-mlbb-text-secondary/65">over</span><a class="font-semibold text-text-accent transition-colors hover:text-mlbb-gold-bright" href="/items/queens-wings">Queen&#x27;s Wings</a></span><span class="basis-full text-[12.5px] text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use against repeated magic damage from mages like Chang&#x27;e or Gord where Radiant Armor stacks outvalue Queen&#x27;s Wings burst protection.</span></li></ul></div></div></article><article id="build-3" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="build-tab-3" hidden="" class="group/build relative overflow-hidden border border-mlbb-gold/22 bg-surface-2/92 scroll-mt-24" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04) inset, 0 30px 60px -36px rgba(0,0,0,0.95);opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[0.06] hex-pattern" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-x-0 top-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold-bright/80 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute left-0 top-0 h-full w-[3px] bg-gradient-to-b from-mlbb-gold-bright/70 via-mlbb-gold/30 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full blur-3xl transition-opacity duration-500 group-hover/build:opacity-90" aria-hidden="true" style="background-color:#FF8C001f"></div><span class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-4 top-2 font-heading text-[140px] font-black leading-none text-text-accent-bright/[0.04] sm:-right-2 sm:top-0 sm:text-[180px]" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div class="relative p-4 sm:p-5"><header class="mb-4 flex flex-col gap-2.5 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap sm:items-start sm:justify-between"><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase leading-tight tracking-[0.04em] text-mlbb-text sm:text-2xl">Hybrid EXP Bruiser</h3><p class="mt-1.5 max-w-2xl text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-mlbb-text-secondary sm:text-sm xl:max-w-none">Balanced setup for drafts where the enemy has one priority kick target but enough dive threat to punish full-damage Chou. Brute Force Breastplate adds stacking CC reduction, adaptive attack, and movement speed per second of combat, which stacks with Tough Boots to make Chou nearly CC-immune during extended fights.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 sm:shrink-0"><div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-gold-bright/35 bg-gradient-to-br from-mlbb-gold-bright/12 to-mlbb-gold-bright/2 px-3 py-1.5"><span class="font-heading text-[9px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-text-accent/85">Cost</span><span class="font-heading text-[13px] font-bold tracking-wide text-text-accent-bright">10,800<!-- -->g</span></div><a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border border-mlbb-blue/35 bg-gradient-to-br from-mlbb-blue/14 to-mlbb-blue/3 px-3 py-1.5 font-heading text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-mlbb-blue-light transition-all duration-200 hover:border-mlbb-blue-light/60 hover:bg-mlbb-blue/20 hover:text-[#9fdcff]" href="/build-simulator?hero=chou&amp;items=tough-boots%2Cblade-of-the-heptaseas%2Cwar-axe%2Cbrute-force-breastplate%2Cmalefic-roar%2Cimmortality&amp;spell=flicker&amp;emblem=fighter&amp;talents=firmness%2Cfestival-of-blood%2Cbrave-smite&amp;flex=endless-battle.brute-force-breastplate%2Cdominance-ice.malefic-roar%2Csea-halberd.malefic-roar%2Cradiant-armor.malefic-roar">Simulator<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" str