ckground:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #2ECC71, transparent)"></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="mt-6 text-center"><a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-text-accent hover:text-text-accent-bright transition-colors font-heading uppercase tracking-wider" href="/heroes">Browse All Heroes<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right w-4 h-4" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg></a></div></section></div></section></div><section class="content-lazy relative border-t border-border-subtle py-12 md:py-16" aria-labelledby="hero-faq-heading"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/chou#faq","url":"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/chou","inLanguage":"en","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best Chou build in 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Chou's strongest build centers on Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe and Endless Battle as core items, paired with the Fighter Emblem and the Flicker battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is the best emblem for Chou?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The recommended emblem for Chou is Fighter Emblem, set up with the Firmness, Festival of Blood and Brave Smite talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What lane and role is Chou in Mobile Legends?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Chou is a Fighter hero, usually played in the EXP Lane and as a Roamer. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Who counters Chou?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Chou is countered most by Phoveus, Esmeralda and Cyclops, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Chou in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Chou beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is Chou hard to play?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Chou is rated Medium difficulty in Mobile Legends. Chou rewards some practice with positioning and combos but stays approachable for most ranked players."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What is Chou's win rate this patch?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Chou currently holds a 45.1% win rate, a 1.1% pick rate, and a 3.1% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section."}}]}</script><div class="container-mlbb relative z-10"><div class="mb-6 flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center border border-mlbb-gold/30 bg-mlbb-gold/10 text-text-accent" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-circle-question-mark h-4 w-4" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path></svg></span><h2 id="hero-faq-heading" class="font-heading text-xl font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.04em] text-text-accent-bright md:text-2xl">Chou FAQ</h2></div><p class="mb-6 max-w-[80ch] text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted md:text-[15px]">Chou is a Fighter hero played in the EXP Lane and as a Roamer.<!-- --> Its strongest build centers on Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe, Endless Battle; open the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/build-simulator?hero=chou&amp;items=tough-boots%2Cblade-of-the-heptaseas%2Cwar-axe%2Cendless-battle%2Cmalefic-roar%2Cimmortality&amp;spell=flicker&amp;emblem=fighter&amp;talents=firmness%2Cfestival-of-blood%2Cbrave-smite&amp;flex=warrior-boots.tough-boots%2Csea-halberd.malefic-roar%2Coracle.immortality%2Cradiant-armor.malefic-roar">Chou build simulator</a> for the full item order and final stats, or compare every available loadout on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/builds/chou">Chou builds page</a>. <!-- -->See every hero that beats it on the <a class="font-semibold text-text-accent underline decoration-text-accent/30 underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-text-accent-bright" href="/counter/chou">Chou counter page</a>.</p><div class="space-y-3"><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="_R_falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best Chou build in 2026?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 rotate-180 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_falubsnnauivbH1_" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[1fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Chou&#x27;s strongest build centers on Blade of the Heptaseas, War Axe and Endless Battle as core items, paired with the Fighter Emblem and the Flicker battle spell. The full six-item order, flex options for different matchups, and talent setup are in the build section on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is the best emblem for Chou?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">The recommended emblem for Chou is Fighter Emblem, set up with the Firmness, Festival of Blood and Brave Smite talents. The full emblem and talent breakdown, including alternatives for specific matchups, is in the build section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_valubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What lane and role is Chou in Mobile Legends?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_valubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_valubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Chou is a Fighter hero, usually played in the EXP Lane and as a Roamer. Role and lane decide which builds, emblems, and counters matter most, all of which are covered on this page.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Who counters Chou?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_17alubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_17alubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Chou is countered most by Phoveus, Esmeralda and Cyclops, the heroes with the biggest measured edge against Chou in ranked play. The full counter list, the heroes Chou beats, and game-phase tips are in the counters section.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>Is Chou hard to play?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1falubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1falubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Chou is rated Medium difficulty in Mobile Legends. Chou rewards some practice with positioning and combos but stays approachable for most ranked players.</p></div></div></div></div><div class="glass-card overflow-hidden"><h3 class="text-sm md:text-base font-heading font-semibold"><button id="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" class="w-full flex items-center justify-between gap-3 p-5 text-left cursor-pointer text-[#E8E6E3] hover:text-[#C8AA6E] transition-colors"><span>What is Chou&#x27;s win rate this patch?</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-down w-4 h-4 flex-shrink-0 transition-transform duration-200 text-[#9BA0B4]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m6 9 6 6 6-6"></path></svg></button></h3><div id="_R_1nalubsnnauivb_" role="region" aria-labelledby="_R_1nalubsnnauivbH1_" inert="" class="grid transition-[grid-template-rows] duration-200 grid-rows-[0fr]"><div class="overflow-hidden"><div class="px-5 pb-5 -mt-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed">Chou currently holds a 45.1% win rate, a 1.1% pick rate, and a 3.1% ban rate in ranked Mobile Legends, refreshed daily from match data. Win and pick rates broken down by rank, from Epic to Mythical Glory, are in the rank stats section.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></div></main><footer class="content-lazy relative bg-[#000000] border-t border-[#C8AA6E]/20 overflow-hidden"><div class="absolute inset-0 hex-pattern opacity-40 pointer-events-none"></div><div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" style="background:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 60% at 50% 100%, rgba(200,170,110,0.03), transparent)"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-[2px] z-10 overflow-hidden energy-line" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative z-10 pt-4 pb-4"><div class="container-mlbb"><div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-x-12 gap-y-8"><div class="col-span-1 sm:col-span-2"><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-4"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield w-7 h-7 text-[#C8AA6E]" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg><span class="font-heading text-xl font-bold tracking-wider text-gradient-gold">MLBB<span class="text-gradient-blue">Hub</span></span></div><p class="mb-6 max-w-sm border-l-2 border-mlbb-gold-bright/70 pl-3 font-heading text-base font-semibold uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.1em] text-text-accent-bright">Win with data, not dram