",\"name\":\"How to Build Chou in Mobile Legends: EXP Damage Dealer\",\"description\":\"Default EXP setup for solo queue. Heptaseas rush into War Axe gives enough burst to kill a squishy from fog. Endless Battle's Divine Justice true damage fires off every skill cast during the combo chain.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Blade of the Heptaseas\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Fighter Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Flicker Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the EXP Damage Dealer build for Chou.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/chou#build-exp-damage-dealer\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Blade of the Heptaseas\",\"text\":\"Purchase Blade of the Heptaseas (1,950 gold) as item 2 in the EXP Damage Dealer build for Chou.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/chou#build-exp-damage-dealer\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy War Axe\",\"text\":\"Purchase War Axe (2,100 gold) as item 3 in the EXP Damage Dealer build for Chou.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/chou#build-exp-damage-dealer\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Endless Battle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Endless Battle (2,330 gold) as item 4 in the EXP Damage Dealer build for Chou.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/chou#build-exp-damage-dealer\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Roar\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Roar (2,060 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Damage Dealer build for Chou.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/chou#build-exp-damage-dealer\"},{\"@t