/esportpedia.b-cdn.net/mlbbhub/skins/chou/Hero265-portrait-20220525164853.webp\",\"splashUrl\":null,\"sourceUrl\":\"https://mobile-legends.fandom.com/wiki/Chou/Cosmetics\"}],\"lore\":{\"backstory\":\"Born in the slums of the Cadia Riverlands, Chou was orphaned during a bandit raid that destroyed his village. Taken in by a wandering martial arts master, he trained for years in an ancient kung fu discipline known as the Way of the Dragon. His unmatched speed and devastating kicks have earned him legendary status across the Land of Dawn. Chou now wanders the realm seeking worthy opponents, believing that true strength is forged through endless battle.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"paquito\",\"heroName\":\"Paquito\",\"relationship\":\"Fellow martial arts champion and sparring partner\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"fanny\",\"heroName\":\"Fanny\",\"relationship\":\"Trained together under the same mountain monastery\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"aldous\",\"heroName\":\"Aldous\",\"relationship\":\"Rival who once defeated him in single combat\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"yu-zhong\",\"heroName\":\"Yu Zhong\",\"relationship\":\"Ancient martial challenge remains unresolved\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"$undefined\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":45.55,\"pickRate\":1.03,\"banRate\":3.59},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":45.42,\"pickRate\":1.01,\"banRate\":3.58},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":45.14,\"pickRate\":0.99,\"banRate\":3.42},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":45.21,\"pickRate\":0.96,\"banRate\":2.88},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":45.18,\"pickRate\":0.93,\"banRate\":3.01},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":44.51,\"pickRate\":1.22,\"banRate\":3.34},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":45.1,\"pickRate\":1.11,\"banRate\":3.06}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Chou\",\"heroSlug\":\"chou\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"diff